    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the tranquil world of Crabs, a relaxing way to experience the joys and quirks of owning a hermit crab without the mess of a real-life tank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This  simulator and idle game puts you in the role of a dedicated hermit crab caretaker. Your mission is to keep your little crustacean friend happy, healthy, and thriving in its cozy habitat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Care for Your Crab</strong> \u2013 It\u2019s simple. Get a crab, bring it home, and keep its food and water topped up for a few days. Take it out for a backyard adventure. When you are done spending time with your crab you can ALT-F4. The Crab will survive will the game is off as long as it has food and water. Make sure to check in before it runs out and refill as needed. Keep your crab alive as long as possible. Train it to improve its skills and discover new abilities along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Gameplay</strong> \u2013 The game continues even when you are not playing, so there is no need to keep it open between visits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backyard Adventure</strong> \u2013 Take control of your crab and explore the backyard. Discover secrets, face threats, and solve puzzles to discover new traits and abilities for your crabs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tank Variety and Customization</strong> \u2013 Unlock larger tank designs and customize them with decorations to create the perfect environment for your crab. (Coming soon)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for anyone looking for a low-pressure gameplay experience, Crabs captures the simple joy of caring for a hermit crab. Whether you are a longtime hermit crab enthusiast or just curious about these fascinating creatures, this game invites you to slow down and enjoy life\u2019s tiny wonders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crabs is in early access and does not represent the final product. I will do my best at regular updates to improve the experience and add new features. Some content is still a work in progress. Please visit the Discord to report any bugs and share your feedback.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the tranquil world of Crabs, a relaxing way to experience the joys and quirks of owning a hermit crab without the mess of a real-life tank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This  simulator and idle game puts you in the role of a dedicated hermit crab caretaker. Your mission is to keep your little crustacean friend happy, healthy, and thriving in its cozy habitat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Care for Your Crab</strong> \u2013 It\u2019s simple. Get a crab, bring it home, and keep its food and water topped up for a few days. Take it out for a backyard adventure. When you are done spending time with your crab you can ALT-F4. The Crab will survive will the game is off as long as it has food and water. Make sure to check in before it runs out and refill as needed. Keep your crab alive as long as possible. Train it to improve its skills and discover new abilities along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Gameplay</strong> \u2013 The game continues even when you are not playing, so there is no need to keep it open between visits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backyard Adventure</strong> \u2013 Take control of your crab and explore the backyard. Discover secrets, face threats, and solve puzzles to discover new traits and abilities for your crabs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tank Variety and Customization</strong> \u2013 Unlock larger tank designs and customize them with decorations to create the perfect environment for your crab. (Coming soon)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for anyone looking for a low-pressure gameplay experience, Crabs captures the simple joy of caring for a hermit crab. Whether you are a longtime hermit crab enthusiast or just curious about these fascinating creatures, this game invites you to slow down and enjoy life\u2019s tiny wonders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crabs is in early access and does not represent the final product. I will do my best at regular updates to improve the experience and add new features. Some content is still a work in progress. Please visit the Discord to report any bugs and share your feedback.</p>",
    "short_description": "Take care of your very own hermit crab in Crabs! Raise and train your crab to explore the backyard, uncover hidden secrets, and develop new abilities. Keep your crab alive by checking in regularly in this offline idle simulator. Get Crabs and Take Responsibility.",
